# {{ name.title }}

A FastAPI service on Python {{ python_version }}, uv, SQLAlchemy 2 (async){% if options.migrations %}, Alembic{% endif %} and
Pydantic v2, generated by [moarch-py](https://pypi.org/project/moarch-py/).

## First run

```bash
uv sync                       # creates .venv from uv.lock
cp .env.example .env          # then fill it in
{% if options.migrations %}
uv run alembic upgrade head   # create the tables
{% endif %}
uv run fastapi dev src/{{ name.package }}/main.py
```

Open http://localhost:8000/docs for the interactive API.
{% if options.docker %}

With Docker instead (starts {% if database.runs_in_container %}the database too{% else %}the API with a SQLite volume{% endif %}):

```bash
docker compose up --build
```
{% endif %}

## Everyday commands

| Task | Command |
|---|---|
| Run the tests | `uv run pytest` |
| Format | `uv run ruff format .` |
| Lint | `uv run ruff check .` |
| Type-check | `uv run mypy src` |
| Add a feature | `moarch-py create feature <name>` |
{% if options.migrations %}
| New migration | `uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "<what changed>"` |
| Apply migrations | `uv run alembic upgrade head` |
{% endif %}
| Format + lint on save | VS Code: install the recommended Ruff extension (`.vscode/`) |
| Add a package | `uv add <package>` (`uv add --dev <package>` for tools) |

## Layout

```
src/{{ name.package }}/
├── main.py          app factory: settings, database, middleware, routers
├── core/            settings, logging, errors
├── db/              Base, session, BaseRepository, the models registry
├── api/
│   ├── health.py    /health and /health/ready
│   └── v1/router.py every feature router, under /api/v1
└── features/<name>/ models · schemas · repository · service · router · dependencies
```

How a request moves through those files is in
[docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).
